{"id":"tras","lemma":"tras","pos":"prep","rank":522,"glosses":["after, following, in the wake of; upon","behind (on the far side of)","beyond"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tras.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tras la tormenta llegó la calma.","en":"After the storm, it was calm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333122","words":[null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"storm"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Le entró sueño tras la cena.","en":"She became drowsy after supper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306361","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to enter","l":"entrar"},{"g":"sleep, slumber"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"supper, dinner"}]},{"text":"Los clientes llegaron uno tras otro.","en":"Customers came one after another.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/833085","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"client","l":"cliente"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"one"},null,{"g":"someone else"}]},{"text":"Vi a un gato corriendo tras el perro.","en":"I saw a cat running after the dog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522126","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"to run, to jog","l":"correr"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog"}]},{"text":"¿Cómo te relajas tras el trabajo?","en":"How do you relax after work?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462074","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to relax, to loosen","l":"relajar"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"}]}]}